2026-07-27T08:26:05.0849701Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T08:26:05.0917810Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:26:05.0918952Z i /tmp/RtmpFYoV2V/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:26:05.0919668Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:26:05.0920223Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:26:05.0920976Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:26:05.0921688Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:26:05.0922749Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:26:05.0923833Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T08:26:05.1181255Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:26:05.1291898Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:26:05.1738968Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:26:05.1902163Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
